<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 6.5 bln skr in T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 6.5 bln skr in T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would auction 6.5 billion crowns of Treasury bills on April 2.</p>
<p>It said bids are due by 1030 GMT on the day of the auction. Settlement date is April 4. Maturity date		Issue volume	    Number</p>
<p>							    of days</p>
<p>July 16, 1997		500 million Skr	 102</p>
<p>October 15, 1997	   1.0 billion Skr	 191</p>
<p>March 18, 1998	     5.0 billion Skr	 344</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
